Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.58,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.6}Told his title
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.58,0:00:01.54,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.6}parade was Thursday,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.54,0:00:02.94,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.6}Nikola Jokic said no.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.94,0:00:03.47,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.6}He was worried
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.47,0:00:03.84,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.6}it would make
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.84,0:00:04.68,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.6}him miss his family's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.68,0:00:05.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.6}horse races in Serbia.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.80,0:00:06.53,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.6}But at the parade,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.53,0:00:07.27,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.6}he told Denver
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.27,0:00:07.93,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.6}he did not want
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.93,0:00:08.53,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.6}to leave it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.53,0:00:09.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.6}Six days after the title,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.60,0:00:10.32,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.6}he was at the track
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.32,0:00:10.97,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.6}in Sombor,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.97,0:00:12.02,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.6}in a Dream Catcher shirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.02,0:00:12.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.6}He watched every race
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.80,0:00:13.61,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.6}his family entered,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.61,0:00:14.85,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.6}and answered no reporters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.85,0:00:15.17,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.6}He said
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.17,0:00:16.05,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.6}no to the parade.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.05,0:00:17.22,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.6}Never to the horses.
